{"crc":"1f261dec","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"Looking at the issue, the problem is that `Symbol` instances have a `__dict__` since version 1.7, which shouldn't happen when `__slots__` is properly defined. The issue suggests that some parent class accidentally stopped defining `__slots__`.\n\nLet me trace the inheritance chain:\n- `Symbol` extends `AtomicExpr` and `Boolean`\n- `AtomicExpr` extends `Atom` and `Expr`\n- `Expr` extends `Basic` and `EvalfMixin`\n\nLooking at the files:\n- `Symbol` has `__slots__ = ('name',)` ✓\n- `Basic` has `__slots__ = ('_mhash', '_args', '_assumptions')` ✓\n- `Expr` has `__slots__ = ()` ✓\n\nThe problem is in `Expr.__slots__ = ()`. When a class defines `__slots__ = ()`, it means \"no additional slots beyond what parent classes define.\" However, for `__slots__` to work properly and prevent `__dict__` creation, ALL classes in the inheritance chain must define `__slots__`. \n\nLooking at `EvalfMixin` - it's a mixin class that likely doesn't define `__slots__`. If `EvalfMixin` doesn't have `__slots__`, then any class inheriting from it (like `Expr`) will get a `__dict__` unless `Expr` explicitly includes `__dict__` in its slots or the chain is complete.\n\nThe fix should be to add `__slots__` to `EvalfMixin`. Let me check if there's an `EvalfMixin` class definition. It's imported from `.evalf` in `expr.py`.\n\nLet me look at the `sympy/core/evalf.py` file to find `EvalfMixin`:\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the issue, the problem is that `Expr` defines `__slots__ = ()` but inherits from `Basic` (which has `__slots__`) and `EvalfMixin` (which likely doesn't have `__slots__`). When a class inherits from a class without `__slots__`, it gets a `__dict__` unless all parent classes have `__slots__`.\n\nThe fix should be to add `__slots__ = ()` to `EvalfMixin` in `sympy/core/evalf.py`.\n\nLet me search for the EvalfMixin class:\n\n# path: sympy/core/evalf.py\n```python\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\nclass EvalfMixin:\n    \"\"\"Mixin class adding evalf capabililty.\"\"\"\n=======\nclass EvalfMixin:\n    \"\"\"Mixin class adding evalf capabililty.\"\"\"\n    __slots__ = ()\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n```","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZQWTFM4C0ER59Z83J1R71JR","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZQWTFKWK3ZP2AC93KXQDJQ2"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786434648.921393}
